{"title": "Wesley's Moons Wiki", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"mp-container\" data-rootpage=\"Wesley&#39;s Moons Wiki\" style=\"--main-page-layout--desktop: &#39;welcome welcome welcome&#39; &#39;about about pages&#39; &#39;contribute external external&#39;;--main-page-layout--tablet: &#39;welcome welcome&#39; &#39;about pages&#39; &#39;contribute external&#39;;--main-page-layout--mobile: &#39;welcome&#39; &#39;about&#39; &#39;pages&#39; &#39;external&#39; &#39;contribute&#39;;\"><div class=\"mp-box\" style=\"grid-area:welcome;\" id=\"mp-box-welcome\" data-box-id=\"welcome\"><h2><span id=\"Welcome_to_the_Wesley.27s_Moons_Wiki.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Welcome_to_the_Wesley's_Moons_Wiki!\"> Welcome to the Wesley's Moons Wiki! </span></h2><div class=\"mp-body\">\n<p>We are currently maintaining <a href=\"/wiki/Special:AllPages\" title=\"Special:AllPages\">117 articles</a>. Please feel free to contribute by creating new articles or expanding existing ones.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"mp-box\" style=\"grid-area:about;\" id=\"mp-box-about\" data-box-id=\"about\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\"> About </span></h2><div class=\"mp-body\">\n<dl><dt><span style=\"font-family: Orbitron; font-size: 125%;\">Moons</span></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Wesley's Moons is a collection of <b>52 moons</b> with a roguelike system built in made by <b>Magic_Wesley</b> for the indie title <b>Lethal Company</b>. All the moons have unique ideas and concepts behind them; with each moon you explore having varying challenges to face, and areas to explore!</li>\n<li>The new roguelike system will have you unlock new moons through a simple progression system that'll take you on a couple journeys through a collection of moons.</li>\n<li>Moons can have unique hazards that can be seen on exterior or within the interior.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><span style=\"font-family: Orbitron; font-size: 125%;\">Interiors</span></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>There is also Wesley's Interiors which currently adds <b>13 unique interiors</b>.</li>\n<li>Most interiors have their own hazards and some of them even events which you can trigger.</li>\n<li>There are also interiors with special mechanics which will make your gameplay more untypical.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><span style=\"font-family: Orbitron; font-size: 125%;\">Items</span></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Wesley's Moons features 500+ items which are:\n<ul><li>Wesley's Scrap</li>\n<li>Loggable items</li>\n<li>Videotapes</li>\n<li>Ingredient items</li>\n<li>Key items</li>\n<li>Reward items</li>\n<li>Action fiugres</li>\n<li>Destiny items</li>\n<li>Unused items</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"mp-box\" style=\"grid-area:external;\" id=\"mp-box-external\" data-box-id=\"external\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\"> External links </span></h2><div class=\"mp-body\">\n<div class=\"mp-links columns-2\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://thunderstore.io/c/lethal-company/p/Magic_Wesley/Wesleys_Moons/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Thudnbsadnerstore.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Thudnbsadnerstore.png/150px-Thudnbsadnerstore.png?6d0b1b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Thudnbsadnerstore.png/225px-Thudnbsadnerstore.png?6d0b1b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Thudnbsadnerstore.png/300px-Thudnbsadnerstore.png?6d0b1b 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"456\" /></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thunderstore.io/c/lethal-company/p/Magic_Wesley/Wesleys_Moons/\">Mod Thunderstore Page</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/dPBc7jcU8Z\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discordtransparent1.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Discordtransparent1.png/150px-Discordtransparent1.png?eca3a4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Discordtransparent1.png/225px-Discordtransparent1.png?eca3a4 1.5x, /images/thumb/Discordtransparent1.png/300px-Discordtransparent1.png?eca3a4 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/dPBc7jcU8Z\">Discord Server</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Dz59j28WXT\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Lcmodpfp.gif\" src=\"/images/Lcmodpfp.gif?d013bc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Dz59j28WXT\">Lethal Company Modding Server</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLCZ5PSvYyDUg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"YouTube.svg\" src=\"https://commons.wiki.gg/images/YouTube.svg?61b4b3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"104\" data-file-width=\"159\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLCZ5PSvYyDUg\">Wesley's Moons Trailers Playlist</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"mp-box\" style=\"grid-area:contribute;\" id=\"mp-box-contribute\" data-box-id=\"contribute\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contribute_to_the_wiki\"> Contribute to the wiki </span></h2><div class=\"mp-body\">\n<p>Wesley's Moons Wiki is a collaborative wiki resource that is open for anyone to edit. You don't need special permission beyond <a href=\"/wiki/Special:UserLogin/signup\" title=\"Special:UserLogin/signup\">registering</a> an account to edit most pages, and your contributions can grow the wiki and help other players.\n</p>\n<dl><dt><span style=\"font-family: Orbitron; font-size: 125%;\">Adding content</span></dt>\n<dd>\n<ul><li>If you are unsure of what to do or how to create a page, search for a few articles on the same topic and see what they look like. You can always view the source code in a wiki and learn from what others have done.</li>\n<li>An edit doesn't have to be massive; if you feel you don't want to create whole articles, then just fixing spelling errors and broken links is enough.</li>\n<li><b><a href=\"/wiki/Special:UserLogin/signup\" title=\"Special:UserLogin/signup\">Register</a></b> to edit and track your contributions.</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><span style=\"font-family: Orbitron; font-size: 125%;\">Who to Contact</span></dt>\n<dd>If you need help, or are unsure if an edit is worth adding, Contact <b>Absolute_Lambda</b> on Discord if possible.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"mp-box centered-content\" style=\"grid-area:pages;\" id=\"mp-box-pages\" data-box-id=\"pages\"><h2><span id=\"Wesley.27s_Moons\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wesley's_Moons\"> Wesley's Moons </span></h2><div class=\"mp-body\">\n<div class=\"mp-links columns-2\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moons\" title=\"Moons\"><img alt=\"WesleysMoonsIcon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/WesleysMoonsIcon.png/150px-WesleysMoonsIcon.png?d1a5ba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/WesleysMoonsIcon.png/225px-WesleysMoonsIcon.png?d1a5ba 1.5x, /images/WesleysMoonsIcon.png?d1a5ba 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/Moons\" title=\"Moons\">Moons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Guidebook\" title=\"Guidebook\"><img alt=\"Light Bulb Icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Light_Bulb_Icon.png/87px-Light_Bulb_Icon.png?a39c8f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"87\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Light_Bulb_Icon.png/131px-Light_Bulb_Icon.png?a39c8f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Light_Bulb_Icon.png/174px-Light_Bulb_Icon.png?a39c8f 2x\" data-file-width=\"270\" data-file-height=\"465\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/Guidebook\" title=\"Guidebook\">Guidebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Interiors\" title=\"Interiors\"><img alt=\"Wesley interiors.png\" src=\"/images/Wesley_interiors.png?e8fc48\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/Interiors\" title=\"Interiors\">Interiors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Weathers\" title=\"Weathers\"><img alt=\"Weathers icon.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Weathers_icon.png/150px-Weathers_icon.png?760c05\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Weathers_icon.png/225px-Weathers_icon.png?760c05 1.5x, /images/Weathers_icon.png?760c05 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/Weathers\" title=\"Weathers\">Weathers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\"><img alt=\"Scrap Icon Pixalated Colored.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Scrap_Icon_Pixalated_Colored.png/150px-Scrap_Icon_Pixalated_Colored.png?8e2c93\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Scrap_Icon_Pixalated_Colored.png/225px-Scrap_Icon_Pixalated_Colored.png?8e2c93 1.5x, /images/Scrap_Icon_Pixalated_Colored.png?8e2c93 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Items</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>", "images": ["Thudnbsadnerstore.png", "Discordtransparent1.png", "Lcmodpfp.gif", "YouTube.svg", "WesleysMoonsIcon.png", "Light_Bulb_Icon.png", "Wesley_interiors.png", "Weathers_icon.png", "Scrap_Icon_Pixalated_Colored.png"], "cats": ["Wesley's_Moons_Wiki"]}